FUNCTION HTTPGET(URL)
* mvx-lang/curl-cmd — HTTP GET returning the response body, via the OS `curl`
* command (the "command" HTTP transport; the libcurl in-process version lives in
* mvx-lang/curl).  curl-cmd provides the virtual name "curl", so it satisfies a
* dependency on "curl" with no compiler or libcurl needed — only the curl
* binary, which mvpkg already requires.  GPL-2.0-only.
   TMP = "/tmp/curlcmd_get_" : @USERNO
   EXECUTE '!curl -sL "' : URL : '" > ' : TMP
   BODY = ""
   OSREAD BODY FROM TMP ELSE BODY = ""
   EXECUTE '!rm -f "' : TMP : '"'
   RETURN BODY
